          "id": "9s6kcrttv50y",
          "status": "investigating",
          "body": "Job processing and job scheduling is degraded, which is affecting scheduled and asynchronous work across several products, including Jira, Confluence and Bitbucket Cloud.\n\nAffected users may see delayed or missing job execution, including delayed email-to-ticket processing and schedules that do not run as expected.",
